abstract: Initial AI transcription of a 1871 Fuzhou hospital booklet, catalogued as
  醫館略述 and printed as 醫館畧述, held as Bodleian Sinica 2017. It preserves historical
  hospital and charity narratives, donor lists, printed diagram text and captions;
  historical treatment claims and figures have not been verified. Initial AI transcription;
  independent reading not applied; no human double collation, expert review, peer
  review or measured accuracy.
